requirements.detail:
Each nut size must withstand specified proof load testing: 
a) Class 8S: M16 (168.9 kN), M20 (263.4 kN), M22 (325.7 kN), M24 (379.5 kN), M27 (403.4 kN), M30 (603.1 kN), M36 (878.3 kN); 
b) Class 10S: M16 (195.5 kN), M20 (305.0 kN), M22 (377.0 kN), M24 (439.0 kN), M27 (467.0 kN), M30 (698.0 kN), M36 (1016.0 kN).
